# Never let secrets or local state into an image layer (brief §11 — the most
# common way secrets end up in a published image; layers are extractable).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.agent
**/.commandcode
**/.testsprite
docs/
prds/
testsprite_tests/
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/.DS_Store
# Secrets material — mounted at runtime via Docker secrets, never baked in.
secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
